 "name_en": "Treasury Workstation Cash Integration (34P)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Treasury Workstation Cash Integration (34P)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio42a6e31791144307b34622f44ccd8049\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio42a6e31791144307b34622f44ccd8049__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Treasury Workstation Cash Integration makes it possible for the <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> treasury workstation, normally set up in a group headquarters, to receive the cash flow data from any remote systems of the subsidiaries. This data is incorporated into the various cash reports (for example, Cash Position, Check Cash Flow Items, and Cash Flow Analyzer) for the cash disposition analysis.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">With <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span> or SAP S/4HANA on either side of the communication, the house bank and account master data can be replicated from one end to the other.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio42a6e31791144307b34622f44ccd8049__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Send the cash flows into the <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> treasury workstation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Release the cash flows</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Check cash flows</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Replicate the house bank and account data from <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> to <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span></li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Replicate the house bank and account data from <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span> to <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span></li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor replication</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio42a6e31791144307b34622f44ccd8049__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Receive more comprehensive and accurate cash disposition analysis on the group level</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Deploy the group system landscape flexibly</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Ensure consistent house bank and account master data between the headquarter and the subsidiaries</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>资金工作站现金集成 (34P)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio42a6e31791144307b34622f44ccd8049\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio42a6e31791144307b34622f44ccd8049__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">资金工作站现金集成使通常在集团总部设置的 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 资金工作站可以从子公司的任何远程系统接收现金流数据。此数据合并到各种现金报表（例如，现金头寸、检查现金流项目和现金流分析器）以进行现金处置分析。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过通信两侧的 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span> 或 SAP S/4HANA，可以将开户行和账户主数据从一端复制到另一端。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio42a6e31791144307b34622f44ccd8049__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将现金流发送到 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 资金工作站</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批现金流</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">检查现金流</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将开户行和账户数据从 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 复制到 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span></li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将开户行和账户数据从 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span> 复制到 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span></li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控复制</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio42a6e31791144307b34622f44ccd8049__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在集团级别进行更全面、更准确的现金处置分析</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">灵活部署集团系统架构</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确保总部和子公司之间的开户行和账户主数据一致。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
